    "_postman_id": "f0ed3d7a-9cb1-4ad9-bce4-6dbd5cce8c41",
    "name": "Content + Expense + Expense Category Management APIs",
    "description": "Content (`/api/content-management`), expense categories (`/api/expense-category-management`), areas (`/api/area`), and expenses (`/api/expense-management`).\n\n**Expense management (5 server routes only):** `POST /create`, `GET /getAll`, `GET /get/:id`, `PUT /update/:id`, `DELETE /delete/:id`. `GET`/`DELETE` by id use query `franchise_id`. `PUT` uses `franchise_id` in the body for lookup when sent. List: optional `franchise_id`; `sort` or `sort_by`: `id`, `category`, `subcategory`, `expense_name`, `amount`, `date`, `payment_mode` (default `created_at`); `sort_order` asc|desc. Missing/invalid `:id` is rejected by middleware (400), not a separate URL.\n\nIf you see two copies of this collection in Postman, remove the duplicate import from the sidebar.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "cursor-agent"
  },
